OL,3,GNEWSAJudge says legal appeal on
OL,4,ADrumcree parade ban not an 'emergency'
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FA High Court judge says a legal appeal
OL,8,Fby Orangemen following the secretary of
OL,9,Fstate's decision to ban the Drumcree
OL,10,Fparade is not an emergency case.
OL,12,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,13,FBryant banned the contentious Orange
OL,14,FOrder parade at Drumcree on Friday
OL,15,Fsaying the decision "was in the best
OL,16,Finterests of peace".
OL,18,FOrangemen in Portadown went to the High
OL,19,FCourt on Saturday afternoon to seek a
OL,20,Fjudicial review of that decision.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
