OL,3,GNEWSAJudge says legal appeal on
OL,4,ADrumcree parade ban not an 'emergency'
OL,5,Acase
OL,6,
OL,7,FSir Chris Bryant said he received
OL,8,Fadvice from the PSNI chief constable
OL,9,Fthat allowing the procession to go
OL,10,Fahead could lead to serious injury,
OL,11,Fdisorder and wider unrest.
